title: Distribute arbitrary assets in `pallet-dap`
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      An ability to distribute arbitrary assets is added to `pallet-dap`. 

      The distribution will happen on the same schedule as the issuance, i.e. can be 
      configured by setting `Config::IssuanceCadence`. The amounts distributed to 
      the recipients are defined in `AssetAllocation` storage map and can be set by 
      `set_allocations` extrinsic.

      If distribution fails(because of an insufficient balance), no further attempts 
      to distribute the same share again will be made. Instead, an event signalizing 
      the failure will be deposited. But if balance becomes sufficient before the next 
      distribution again, it will be distributed normally.

      Asset distribution may include both native and non-native assets. In case
      of a native asset the distribution mechanism is independent of an issuance:
      native tokens will be issued according to the budget AND distributed according 
      to the asset distribution.

      `Config::Assets` is introduced, which must contain all the assets(native and 
      non-native). For example, it can be configured as 
      `type Assets = UnionOf<Balances, Assets, ...>` in runtime.
  - audience: Runtime User
    description: |
      An ability to distribute arbitrary assets is added to `pallet-dap`. 

      The distribution will happen on the same schedule as the issuance.

      If distribution fails(because of an insufficient balance), no further attempts 
      to distribute the same share again will be made. Instead, an event signalizing 
      the failure will be deposited. But if balance becomes sufficient before the next 
      distribution again, it will be distributed normally.

      Asset distribution may include both native and non-native assets. In case
      of a native asset the distribution mechanism is independent of an issuance:
      native tokens will be issued according to the budget AND distributed according 
      to the asset distribution.
crates:
  - name: pallet-dap
    bump: major
  - name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
    bump: minor
  - name: pallet-staking-async
    bump: minor
  - name: pallet-staking-async-parachain-runtime
    bump: minor
  - name: pallet-ahm-test
    bump: minor
  - name: frame-support
    bump: minor
